--         TrinityCore's world/char/login updater. Date: 2026-07-22
-- ===========================================================================
--
-- The route waypoints are STATIC, map-derived nav data (chain-pathfound from the
-- navmesh, identical across every realm running the same maps) -- so, exactly
-- like handcrafted_road, the DATA ships in-tree rather than making every tester
-- run tools/gen_dungeon_routes.py. Regenerate with that tool and re-dump this
-- file whenever routes change.
--
-- 8318 waypoints across 144 maps. Idempotent: the DELETE clears any
-- prior copy (including a stale generator run) before re-seeding, so re-applying
-- is safe. difficulty is always 0 (dungeon geometry is difficulty-invariant).
-- ===========================================================================

DELETE FROM `playerbot_dungeon_routes`;

























































